<section id="tooltip" class="docs-section">
  <h1 class="section-title">Tooltip</h1>
  <div class="section-body">
    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>A tooltip provides a short details about a specific text or element on the UI in a pop-over. The tip is shown
        on mouse enter,
        and is hidden on mouse leave. The Tooltip doesn't support complex text or operations.</p>
    </div>

    <h4>Tooltip Directions:</h4>
    <p>With IVORY you can show a tooltip in 8 different directions.</p>

    <h6>Example:</h6>
    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-top</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-sm tooltip-top">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-bottom</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-sm tooltip-bottom">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-left</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-sm tooltip-left">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-right</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-sm tooltip-right">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-top-left</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-top-left tooltip-sm">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-top-right</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-top-right tooltip-sm">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-bottom-right</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-bottom-right tooltip-sm">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>I'm using <code>.tooltip-bottom-left</code> class. <a class="iv-tooltip">Hover me <span
            class="tooltip-content tooltip-bottom-left tooltip-sm">A tooltip provides a short description of a
            UI element.</span></a> to preview.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-2">
      <pre>
                <code>
                  &lt;p&gt; <br/>
                  &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;a class="iv-tooltip"&gt;Hover me<br/>
                  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;span class="tooltip-content tooltip-xs top"&gt;Tooltip text&lt;/span&gt;<br/>
                  &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/p&gt;
                </code>
              </pre>
    </div>

    <h4>Tooltip Size:</h4>
    <p>IVORY provides tooltips in 4 different sizes, with the following classes: </p>
    <div class="type-system" style="max-width: 600px;">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Class</th>
            <th>Size</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <p><code>tooltip-xs</code></p>
            </td>
            <td>
              <p>10rem</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <p><code>tooltip-sm</code></p>
            </td>
            <td>
              <p>15rem</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <p><code>tooltip-md</code></p>
            </td>
            <td>
              <p>20rem</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <p><code>tooltip-lg</code></p>
            </td>
            <td>
              <p>25rem</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>